WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:07.600
&lt; (Jeff! Jeff!)

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.760
— Agh! [muffled yells]
— Shh! Shhh!

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:12.340
They'll hear us! They'll hear us!

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:16.880
Just, just do exactly as I say and you'll make it out of this alive, I promise. Shh!

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:18.640
Put this cream all over your face, right now.

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.529
— What? No!
[squirt]

00:00:20.529 --> 00:00:23.260
[struggles] Stop it! Agh!

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:24.940
— There's no time to explain.

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:26.300
You wanna die, Jeff?!

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:27.300
— [sobs] No...!

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.760
— Come on, get up. On the face.
— What is this?!

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:32.580
— Wha—? It's quantum cream. Prevents time burns.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:34.720
— Burns?
— Yeah. From the time machine, Jeff,

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:35.760
from the time machine.

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:39.760
— Why aren't you putting this on?
— How do you think I got here?

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:40.780
— Follow me.
— Yeah.

00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:41.680
— Stay low.
— Okay.

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:45.300
— On my mark. Three, two, one, c'mon.
— Okay...

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:48.240
♪ [intense music] ♪

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:51.700
— &lt; Jeff!
[car passes loudly]

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:55.900
Shit! Get down, that's one of 'em. We gotta take him out.

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:58.800
— Wha—? What? Me?!
— I'm the brains, you're the brawn, remember?

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:00.440
— I can't fight him, he's just some guy!

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:03.520
— You wanna get to that time machine, we gotta get through him.

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:05.820
There's no time to explain, Jeff. Just go!
— [yells]

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:14.180
♪ [music builds] ♪

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:18.300
[yells]
— [man groans]

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:22.180
— [yells]
[offscreen clang]

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:25.740
— [man groans]

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:30.240
[wrench clatters]

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:32.780
— Get the calculator! Get the calculator!
— Okay!

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:33.980
[elevator dings]

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:38.540
— [woman] Oh, my goodness!

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:43.240
— [frantically] What are we doing?!

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:50.260
— This is it. I'll be going first.
— That's the time machine?

00:01:50.260 --> 00:01:51.760
— No, it's a mini-fridge.

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:56.520
Yes, it's a time machine, Jeff! Wake the fuck up and get me inside!

00:01:56.520 --> 00:02:00.520
I've set it to go 10 minutes back. Alright? I'll see you on the other side.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:04.260
— Okay.
— You gotta go this way, and then you gotta swing...

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:10.740
... hold on, no. That wasn't right.
[they strain] [door slams]

00:02:10.740 --> 00:02:13.800
— [pants]

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:20.880
♪ [suspenseful music] ♪

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:22.960
[gasps]

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:27.000
— Hey!
— Whoa! Oh, my god!

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.380
— [man yells]

00:02:29.380 --> 00:02:32.220
— Oh! Agh!

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:40.660
[thud]
Ogh!

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:47.180
[slow heartbeat]

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:55.460
— (Jeff, Jeff...) &gt;

00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:57.940
Jeff! Get...! Get down here!

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:01.080
— What the hell is going on.
— We're 10 minutes in the past.

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:01.960
10 minutes from our target.

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:06.440
— No! You need to tell me what that time machine is, and why that guy was trying to kill me.

00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:08.040
— It's a time machine, it travels you back in time,

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:09.740
and number two...
— No, no...

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:11.900
— ... you killed his friend.
— [stammers] No!

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:13.780
— There's no time to waste, just put this on.

00:03:13.780 --> 00:03:17.580
— Wha—? Why didn't you just set it to 15 minutes back so we'd have 5 minutes to talk?

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:20.320
— C'mon!

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:37.340
♪ [ominous noise] ♪

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:47.400
— Is that me?!
— Well, yeah, 10-minutes-from-the-past you.

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:50.580
— But what am I doing out here?
— Man, don't you get it yet?!

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:53.440
We're all just characters in a video. Everything you know is a lie.

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:57.820
Free will, fate, we're just pawns in their game. We gotta break out.

00:03:58.640 --> 00:04:00.880
— R... really?

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:04.860
— Well, also, those are aliens and we gotta kill 'em and take their spaceship.

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:06.420
Use the wand.

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:12.120
(Jeff, the safe... the safety's on. Jeff, the safety's on.)

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:16.920
(Jeff! Jeff! Jeff, the safety's on!)

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:20.340
[inaudible speech]

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:23.880
[laser fires]
— [groans]

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:25.300
— Oh, God!

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:27.940
[laser fires with intensity]

00:04:27.940 --> 00:04:30.660
— [they scream] [squelch!]

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:33.860
— [he guffaws]

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:36.100
C'mon, man, we gotta get the spaceship!

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:43.200
C'mon. C'mon!

00:04:47.440 --> 00:04:51.280
Alright, you know how to drive one of these things, right?

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:54.960
— Lemme guess.
— What're you doing, man?! You gotta hit the button!

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:59.520
— What button?!
[prolonged car horn] [they scream]

00:05:05.420 --> 00:05:09.540
— Today, my job is to make my friends blow up!
[they scream]

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:13.640
And I know that sounds weird, but it's not as weird as some of the things that happen 'round here.

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:17.760
— There's no reason to risk a man's life here.

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:19.260
[crew laughs hysterically]

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:21.320
— Oh, my God! What are we, what are we doing?

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:25.880
— There's no time to explain. This is a serious piece. [laughs]

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:30.520
— What would be really nice is to get some really incredible pot,

00:05:30.520 --> 00:05:32.300
and smoke it.
— [laughs]

